  "joins/block 1.9-2.4: per calendar block h34=2.34, h35=1.84; per block-with-joins 2.69/2.21.",
  "burst z=3.3 in the finding is an hour-shuffle artefact; bin-level z=1.3.",
  "suggested V1 trigger hour>=24 is a proxy; the density condition (min-amount share >50% AND joins/block >1) fits the data better (h39-40 need no exemption; h34-35 do).",
